  "description": "Introducing Glorious Victory: a meticulously crafted blackletter font that seamlessly blends Fraktur and Old English styles. With its ornate design, it’s the perfect choice for displays, movies, posters, apparel, labels, branding, logotypes, short quotes, and more.\nImmerse yourself in a world of gothic aesthetics, where darkness meets underground culture. Glorious Victory exudes strength and unwavering conviction, making it ideal for gothic, horror, underground, and youthful themes. Equipped with special characters which allow you to effortlessly add exquisite variations to your designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Glorious Victory: a meticulously crafted blackletter font that seamlessly blends Fraktur and Old English styles. With its ornate design, it’s the perfect choice for displays, movies, posters, apparel, labels, branding, logotypes, short quotes, and more.</p>\n<p>Immerse yourself in a world of gothic aesthetics, where darkness meets underground culture. Glorious Victory exudes strength and unwavering conviction, making it ideal for gothic, horror, underground, and youthful themes. Equipped with special characters which allow you to effortlessly add exquisite variations to your designs.</p>",
